WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.791
Let's analyze the situation.

00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:03.333
To fight those thugs--

00:00:03.416 --> 00:00:06.583
No! I can't stand it! I won't stand it!

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Well, I can't stand it either, but--

00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:13.416
It'd mean we could talk wherever we are.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.250
That's why we decided to buy a receiver.

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:22.416
You've made up your mind, then?

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.333
Yeah.

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:25.833
Right.

00:00:29.666 --> 00:00:30.666
Wait a minute.

00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:36.333
If we're going to do this, we need a plan.

00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:40.083
HOW TO DEFEAT BRODY

